{
    "title": "ChowNow: Local Food Ordering",
    "description": "We\u2019re not your usual ordering app. We don\u2019t believe in crazy-high commissions for independent restaurants, to start. Or marked-up menu prices for you. But we still have delivery and takeout from the best local restaurants\u2013so dig in.\r\n\r\nEXPLORE NEARBY RESTAURANTS\r\nSearch for local takeout, delivery, or curbside pickup options by cuisine, restaurant name, deals and more. Maybe you\u2019re looking for a specific type of food? Here\u2019s a taste of what you could find on our app: Italian, Vietnamese, Korean, Japanese, Mexican, Thai, Greek, Chinese, French, Mediterranean, Indian, and a lot more. Check out our map to find places that are open right now, or offering a promotion. Order what you want by customizing menu items, and get it delivered with convenient, real-time tracking updates. \r\n\r\nCHECK OUT FAST\r\nEnable Google Pay or save your card info for easy payment and fast checkout. Plus, quick reordering options help you get your favorites again in a snap.\r\n\r\nGET HELP FROM REAL HUMANS\r\nWe\u2019re here 24/7. Reach out to our team via chat, SMS, phone, or email. We\u2019re here around the clock if you need help\u2014or just want to talk food.\r\n\r\nWE\u2019RE OPEN NEAR YOU\r\nWe\u2019ll help you find the best restaurants at most U.S. locations. Order fresh flavors in Los Angeles, New York, Chicago, San Francisco, Washington DC, Boston, Atlanta, Denver, Portland, Seattle, Philadelphia, Brooklyn, Dallas, Austin, Orange County, San Diego, Cleveland, Minneapolis, and Charlotte.\r\n\r\nSTILL READING?\r\nWe like your style. How about pizza delivery, pasta, burritos, barbecue, sushi, salads, vegetarian, vegan, burgers and fries? \r\n\r\nWe even have desserts, coffee, smoothies\u2014you name it. So go for it. Download the app and grab something good. We\u2019re here if you need help.",
    "descriptionHTML": "We\u2019re not your usual ordering app. We don\u2019t believe in crazy-high commissions for independent restaurants, to start. Or marked-up menu prices for you. But we still have delivery and takeout from the best local restaurants\u2013so dig in.<br><br>EXPLORE NEARBY RESTAURANTS<br>Search for local takeout, delivery, or curbside pickup options by cuisine, restaurant name, deals and more. Maybe you\u2019re looking for a specific type of food? Here\u2019s a taste of what you could find on our app: Italian, Vietnamese, Korean, Japanese, Mexican, Thai, Greek, Chinese, French, Mediterranean, Indian, and a lot more. Check out our map to find places that are open right now, or offering a promotion. Order what you want by customizing menu items, and get it delivered with convenient, real-time tracking updates. <br><br>CHECK OUT FAST<br>Enable Google Pay or save your card info for easy payment and fast checkout. Plus, quick reordering options help you get your favorites again in a snap.<br><br>GET HELP FROM REAL HUMANS<br>We\u2019re here 24/7. Reach out to our team via chat, SMS, phone, or email. We\u2019re here around the clock if you need help\u2014or just want to talk food.<br><br>WE\u2019RE OPEN NEAR YOU<br>We\u2019ll help you find the best restaurants at most U.S. locations. Order fresh flavors in Los Angeles, New York, Chicago, San Francisco, Washington DC, Boston, Atlanta, Denver, Portland, Seattle, Philadelphia, Brooklyn, Dallas, Austin, Orange County, San Diego, Cleveland, Minneapolis, and Charlotte.<br><br>STILL READING?<br>We like your style. How about pizza delivery, pasta, burritos, barbecue, sushi, salads, vegetarian, vegan, burgers and fries? <br><br>We even have desserts, coffee, smoothies\u2014you name it. So go for it. Download the app and grab something good. We\u2019re here if you need help.",
